# ── Runtime data (never commit bank state) ──
# The experience bank, trajectories, runs, and indices are runtime artifacts.
# They are created at runtime under bank_home (default ~/.hermes/or-experience-bank).
# If local testing created them in-project, exclude them:
bank/
episodes/
trajectories/
runs/
archive/
index/
*.jsonl
!references/*.jsonl
config.yaml
config.local.yaml

# ── Documents not for public repo ──
docs/
*.pdf
OR_Agent_Cross_Memory_Induction_本轮讨论总结.md

# ── Temp files ──
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
